; claude: the examples name their textures by a path relative to the
; repo root ("examples3d/checker.png"), which a web page resolves
; relative to itself, i.e. to examples3d/webgl/examples3d/ here; a dune
; rule can only create files in its own directory, hence this one,
; with only the copy. See ../dune's default alias, which builds it.
(rule
  (copy ../../checker.png checker.png))
